Package: deno
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: A modern runtime for JavaScript and TypeScript
 Deno is a simple, modern and secure runtime for JavaScript, TypeScript,
 and WebAssembly that uses V8 and is built in Rust.

Package: denort
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Deno runtime without the tooling (denort)
 denort is the lean Deno runtime binary, without the bundled tooling,
 intended for running pre-bundled Deno programs in production.
